二、English Version
====================================================================

codex-pool is source-available software. It is NOT licensed for
unlimited commercial use.

Permitted:
- Learning, studying, and reading the code.
- Personal use and local deployment.
- Internal, non-commercial use within a company or team.
- Forking this repository to submit issues, pull requests, and
  improvements (subject to this license).

Not permitted without written authorization:
- Operating codex-pool or modified versions as a public website,
  SaaS, or API service, or publicly re-deploying / hosting instances
  for others to use in any form.
- Embedding advertisements, affiliate links, sponsorships, paid
  referrals, or any other monetization in a deployed version.
- Running services with the same or a highly similar purpose as
  codex-pool (account pools, credential management, Codex/API
  relays, or quota aggregation).
- Republishing this project or modified versions under your own
  name (redistribution, resale, or bundling into commercial
  products).
- Using the codex-pool name, logo, screenshots, documentation, or
  promotional materials for commercial services.

The codex-pool name, logo, visual brand, documentation, and public
assets are not licensed with the source code. Do not publicly
deploy, present, or operate any service that could be mistaken for
an official codex-pool service without written authorization.

For licensing inquiries, contact the author via GitHub Issues.

